{"version":2,"slug":"what-you-taught-me-about-hope-slow-english-listening","videoId":"HuXMurDSOBE","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/HuXMurDSOBE","lang":"en","title":"What YOU Taught Me About Hope | Slow English Listening","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Let's talk."},{"start":2,"text":"I've been thinking about hope"},{"start":6,"text":"lately."},{"start":7,"text":"How powerful"},{"start":10,"text":"hope is."},{"start":12,"text":"Hope can change the world. Hope is in"},{"start":17,"text":"the music"},{"start":19,"text":"we listen to. The songs"},{"start":22,"text":"we sing together. The meals"},{"start":26,"text":"we eat"},{"start":27,"text":"that warm our hearts. The laughs we"},{"start":32,"text":"share"},{"start":33,"text":"with strangers and loved ones."},{"start":37,"text":"I think laughter"},{"start":40,"text":"heals our soul."},{"start":42,"text":"Hope is in the flower"},{"start":46,"text":"that somehow"},{"start":48,"text":"is growing straight through"},{"start":52,"text":"a crack"},{"start":53,"text":"in the sidewalk."},{"start":55,"text":"It's in the sun"},{"start":58,"text":"that continues to show up"},{"start":62,"text":"without missing a day."},{"start":65,"text":"It's in the rain"},{"start":67,"text":"that comes just when you need it the"},{"start":71,"text":"most. It's in the stranger that smiles"},{"start":75,"text":"at you"},{"start":77,"text":"walking down the street. In the poetry"},{"start":81,"text":"that inspires us. The painting"},{"start":84,"text":"that represents us"},{"start":87,"text":"and the clothing"},{"start":89,"text":"that we express ourselves in. I feel"},{"start":94,"text":"hopeful"},{"start":96,"text":"when I see"},{"start":97,"text":"a flock of birds in the sky."},{"start":102,"text":"Or when a butterfly"},{"start":105,"text":"lands in front of me."},{"start":108,"text":"I feel hopeful"},{"start":110,"text":"when my favorite song comes on"},{"start":113,"text":"just when I need it."},{"start":116,"text":"When I dance of joy in my room or when I"},{"start":121,"text":"experience something"},{"start":123,"text":"for the first time"},{"start":125,"text":"ever."},{"start":127,"text":"Whether that's a new skill"},{"start":130,"text":"a new song"},{"start":131,"text":"a new person"},{"start":133,"text":"a new feeling good or bad."},{"start":137,"text":"When you feel like all hope"},{"start":141,"text":"is lost dance."},{"start":144,"text":"Sing."},{"start":146,"text":"Observe."},{"start":149,"text":"Appreciate."},{"start":151,"text":"Learn."},{"start":152,"text":"Express."},{"start":154,"text":"And love."},{"start":156,"text":"In my experience"},{"start":159,"text":"hope"},{"start":160,"text":"is the only way."},{"start":163,"text":"And you guys have given me hope"},{"start":166,"text":"in the darkest of days."},{"start":168,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":170,"text":"What is hope to you?"},{"start":173,"text":"What brings you hope?"},{"start":176,"text":"I hope you have the best day today. I"},{"start":181,"text":"hope you find one thing"},{"start":185,"text":"to be grateful for today."},{"start":189,"text":"I hope the sun comes out today. I hope"},{"start":194,"text":"you eat something delicious today."},{"start":199,"text":"I hope you love something today."},{"start":205,"text":"And I hope something loves you today."},{"start":209,"text":"I hope"},{"start":211,"text":"you are safe"},{"start":213,"text":"today."},{"start":214,"text":"I know hope is something that feels"},{"start":218,"text":"scarce today."},{"start":220,"text":"There is so much pain and conflict in"},{"start":224,"text":"the world."},{"start":225,"text":"But hope is something that nobody"},{"start":229,"text":"can take from us."},{"start":231,"text":"And I"},{"start":232,"text":"you hold on"},{"start":234,"text":"to even the smallest piece of hope"},{"start":237,"text":"today. And to all my viewers around the"},{"start":239,"text":"world,"},{"start":241,"text":"thank you"},{"start":242,"text":"for bringing me hope every day."},{"start":245,"text":"What do you hope for today?"},{"start":247,"text":"What do you hope"},{"start":249,"text":"for yourself?"},{"start":251,"text":"And what do you hope"},{"start":253,"text":"for someone else?"},{"start":255,"text":"Count how many times I said hope."},{"start":260,"text":"We've just reached 1 million"},{"start":262,"text":"subscribers."},{"start":264,"text":"And I couldn't be more grateful"},{"start":267,"text":"for all the hope you guys have given me"},{"start":270,"text":"this year."},{"start":271,"text":"And all I want"},{"start":273,"text":"is to try and do the same for you."},{"start":278,"text":"As some of you know,"},{"start":279,"text":"I have an English community"},{"start":282,"text":"where we learn together,"},{"start":285,"text":"we speak together,"},{"start":287,"text":"and we support each other."},{"start":290,"text":"It's something really special."},{"start":292,"text":"And I know lots of you would love to be"},{"start":296,"text":"a part of it"},{"start":298,"text":"to improve your English and create more"},{"start":302,"text":"opportunities for yourself."},{"start":305,"text":"But I also know"},{"start":307,"text":"that for many of you, life isn't easy"},{"start":310,"text":"right now."},{"start":311,"text":"And sometimes it's just not something"},{"start":314,"text":"you can afford."},{"start":316,"text":"So,"},{"start":317,"text":"I'm opening 10 free spots in my"},{"start":321,"text":"community for people who are going"},{"start":324,"text":"through difficult or viewers that are"},{"start":326,"text":"going through difficult situations."},{"start":330,"text":"Wherever you are,"},{"start":331,"text":"there's a link below where you can"},{"start":333,"text":"apply."},{"start":335,"text":"I'll be reading your answers and"},{"start":337,"text":"selecting a group of people"},{"start":340,"text":"who are truly ready for this. And from"},{"start":343,"text":"that group,"},{"start":344,"text":"10 people will be chosen randomly. So,"},{"start":349,"text":"please apply for this if you really need"},{"start":352,"text":"it."},{"start":353,"text":"If you really want it. And be honest"},{"start":356,"text":"with your answers."},{"start":358,"text":"And even if you don't get selected,"},{"start":362,"text":"everyone who enters their information"},{"start":365,"text":"will be invited to join a private live"},{"start":369,"text":"session with me. With all of us."},{"start":372,"text":"Only for those who applied."},{"start":375,"text":"So, no matter what, you're still a part"},{"start":377,"text":"of this."},{"start":379,"text":"Application closes in 5 days."},{"start":382,"text":"So, leave your answers. The link is in"},{"start":384,"text":"the description."},{"start":386,"text":"And if you can afford my course, it's"},{"start":389,"text":"only $16 per month with the annual plan."},{"start":394,"text":"If you're interested, today is the last"},{"start":396,"text":"day to join."},{"start":398,"text":"But, be sure to apply for this only if"},{"start":401,"text":"you truly need it and truly want it."},{"start":405,"text":"If not, then save room for those who do"},{"start":408,"text":"need it. I trust you guys."},{"start":411,"text":"And thank you so much for 1 million"},{"start":413,"text":"subscribers. I trust the 10 spots will"},{"start":416,"text":"be given to those who truly need it."},{"start":419,"text":"So,"},{"start":420,"text":"I hope this brought you hope"},{"start":424,"text":"today."},{"start":425,"text":"Thank you guys for 1 million"},{"start":427,"text":"subscribers."},{"start":428,"text":"I hope"},{"start":431,"text":"you learned something new today."},{"start":434,"text":"And remember,"},{"start":436,"text":"never stop believing."},{"start":440,"text":"Nothing [music] can beat hope."},{"start":444,"text":"See you next week."},{"start":452,"text":"[music]"}]}